    "status": "expanded_reference_dataset_with_derived_large_size_wall_values",
    "limitations": [
      "Nominal outside diameter series is based on ISO 4427-2:2019 Table 1, including sizes through 3000 mm.",
      "This release includes SDR 11 only. Other SDR series are not yet populated.",
      "For OD sizes above 630 mm, nominal wall thickness is provisionally calculated as OD/SDR rounded to 0.1 mm; these values are not transcribed from a controlled copy of Table 2 and must be verified before design.",
      "PE80 and PE100 at the same OD and SDR share the same nominal geometry; their pressure ratings differ because their MRS values differ.",
      "The original PE100 SDR11 values from 32 to 630 mm are retained from a historical BSI product licence referring to ISO 4427-2:2007.",
      "This dataset does not include all dimensional tolerances, minimum bore, ovality requirements, or manufacturer-specific availability.",
      "For straight pipes with OD >= 900 mm, ISO 4427-2:2019 requires maximum out-of-roundness to be specified by agreement between manufacturer and end user.",
      "Verify all nominal wall thicknesses and pressure ratings against the current controlled standard, amendments, and project specification before engineering release."
    ]
  },
